お手紙で是非教えて下さい☁️　　　またね☺︎☻　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHM249TVK9DTY3DM820QHSY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡邉美穂"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-hina-32197":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜🔔*゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202001/mob9cm4NV.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！日向坂46  金村美玖です🏝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月休みは皆様いかがお過ごしでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は久しぶりに家族で旅行に行ってきました〜！楽しかったです〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真をたくさん撮ったので、思い出にブログに載せたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！その前に1つお知らせが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1/8の14:00から4thシングルの個別握手会の受付が開始致します🎊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になる会場&日程はこちらです↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★3月1日（日）千葉：幕張メッセ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★3月8日（日）京都：みやこめっせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★4月4日（土）神奈川：パシフィコ横浜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★4月19日（日）神奈川：パシフィコ横浜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text